d_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-12-30T11:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-01-22T10:49:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nNoticed in Godot version 4.6-beta2.mono\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta2.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K (20 threads) - 31.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf you create a CheckButton in a VBoxContainer and set the CheckButton to left alignment, it is not correctly aligned with the left edge of the VBoxContainer. See also the comparison with the label and button below.\n\nI cannot find any setting in the CheckButton node that could change this.\nThat looks strange. All other UI nodes are aligned to the edge.\nHowever, it is likely that the structure is not the decisive factor, but rather a general error in how the label is aligned within the check button node, perhaps.\n\nThe example image explains it well.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1400\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e06fda1f-3969-4e10-a054-0ac0b68a85f4\" />\n\n<img width=\"798\" height=\"780\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7687663e-dab7-46f6-92a8-234de317eaf8\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee the screenshot for the structure.\n\n- PanelContainer\n  - MarginContainer\n    - VBoxContainer\n        - CheckButton: Container Sizing => Horizontal Left\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nnot available","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114440/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}